      "output": "REQUIREMENTS.md has been written to the project root. Here's a summary of what it covers:\n\n**Rebrand: \"Stellar Horizons\" → \"Moonshot\"**\n\n- **7 in-scope capabilities** (F1–F7) covering brand name replacement across UI text, HTML metadata, constants, social URLs, marketing copy, and test assertions\n- **6 user stories** with Given/When/Then acceptance criteria covering navbar, footer, landing page, contact page, browser title, and social links\n- **~45+ occurrences** of \"Stellar\" identified across 10 files in `apps/web` and `packages/ui`\n- **Key files affected**: `App.tsx`, `LandingPage.tsx`, `index.html`, `companyInfo.ts`, `featureCards.ts`, plus 5 test files\n- **4 open questions** documented regarding social media account validity, email configuration, address format, and exact brand name variation\n- **Testing plan** includes unit test updates for all 4 test files, plus 5 E2E scenarios",
