      "output": "SPEC.md has been created at the project root. Here's a summary of what it covers:\n\n**Key decisions:**\n- **ADR-1**: Direct string replacement over centralized brand config (YAGNI — simple one-time change)\n- **ADR-2**: Inline test assertion updates over shared test fixtures (explicit, matches existing patterns)\n- **ADR-3**: Preserve package names unchanged (out of scope, low risk)\n\n**Scope**: 9 files, ~41 occurrences across:\n- 5 source files (`App.tsx`, `LandingPage.tsx`, `index.html`, `companyInfo.ts`, `featureCards.ts`)\n- 4 unit test files (`Navbar.test.tsx`, `Footer.test.tsx`, `CompanyInfoBlock.test.tsx`, `navigation.test.tsx`)\n- Potential E2E test updates in `e2e/e2e/`\n\n**Architecture**: No structural changes. All existing component interfaces, state patterns, and file organization remain intact. Only string literal values change.",
